    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For the last 16 years Muneerah Vastani, currently Assistant Professor at the School of Nursing and Midwifery in East Africa, has been guiding young nurses as they learn to nurture their patients back to health and conduct research into the science of early childhood development.",
